feat(brand): swap merchant sticker + Club icon set for PurpleBitcoin glyph

The window sticker shipped with a hand-drawn placeholder coin that
looked nothing like the actual PBTC token mark. Replaces it across
every surface — sticker, welcome banner, favicons, PWA manifest —
with the real PurpleBitcoin icon used by PurpleStay/Purple Council.

- Embed the 512px PNG as a base64 data URI in lib/purple-bitcoin-icon.ts
  so the sticker SVG/PNG export stays a single self-contained file (no
  cross-origin canvas taint when downloadPng paints it via <img>).
- Copy icon-512 / icon-192 / apple-touch-icon / favicon-16 / favicon-32
  from the PurpleStay set into public/, replace purple-club-icon.png +
  purple-club-logo.png in place, rewrap the two SVGs around the same
  base64 so any cached external link keeps resolving to the right mark.
- Expand layout.tsx icons metadata (16/32/192/512 + apple touch +
  shortcut) and the PWA manifest (192/512 plus a maskable 512 for
  Android adaptive icons).
- Point welcome-client at /purple-club-icon.png instead of the now-stale
  SVG path.
